# Documentation & Code Sync Checklist

## Nguyen tac

Code, migration, docs **PHAI dong bo**. Moi thay doi schema hoac API contract phai keo theo cap nhat docs **TRONG CUNG PR** (khong tach rieng, khong de sau).

Quy tac nay ton tai vi 3 ly do:

1. Docs loi thoi khien FE team implement sai contract -> mat cong sua.
2. Moi migration thuong keo theo 3-5 file docs can sync.
3. Neu khong co checklist, agent se quen, de docs drift dan.

## Khi nao phai sync

| Trigger | Phai sync |
|---|---|
| Them/sua db/migration/V{n}__*.sql | Bat buoc (xem migration-impact-matrix.mdc) |
| Them/sua field trong Entity | OpenAPI annotation + DTO + api-document.md |
| Them/sua endpoint moi | api-document.md + AGENTS.md muc tuong ung |
| Doi status enum / error code | api-document.md + error-codes.mdc |
| Them module moi | AGENTS.md + docs/03_system_design.md |
| Thay doi Redis key/TTL | flashsale-*.mdc + docs/03_system_design.md |
| Thay doi Lua script | docs/03_system_design.md + concurrency.mdc |
| Thay doi WS event/destination | api-document.md muc 25 + websocket.mdc |
| Thay doi contract FlashSaleOrderPort | flashsale_order_contract.md + flashsale-architecture.mdc |

## Quy tac ra so sau khi tao migration moi

Moi lan tao src/main/resources/db/migration/V{n}__*.sql, agent **PHAI**:

1. **Mo bang matrix migration-impact-matrix.mdc** de xac dinh file docs bi anh huong.
2. **Doc lai** cac file do de biet vi tri can sua.
3. **Bao cao cho user** danh sach file can sync **TRUOC** khi sua (vi source-of-truth.mdc cam tu y sua docs/).
4. Sau khi user duyet -> sua theo thu tu:
   - ERD / bang column (docs/03_system_design.md).
   - Quy uoc chung (docs/api/api-document.md muc 1).
   - Endpoint list (docs/api/api-document.md muc tuong ung).
   - Error code table (docs/api/api-document.md muc 26).
   - AGENTS.md muc lien quan (hoac cac rule tuong ung trong .cursor/rules/).
5. Neu thay doi anh huong user frontend -> ghi ro trong PR body, ping team FE.

## Quy tac cho moi loai file

### docs/01_project_planning.md

- Cap nhat khi: thay doi milestone (M1/M2/M3), pham vi do an, ke hoach tuan.
- KHONG them chi tiet ky thuat vao day (chi tiet o 02, 03).
- Lenh kiem tra nhanh: grep "M[123]\|Tuan" docs/01_project_planning.md.

### docs/02_requirement_analysis.md

- Cap nhat khi: them/sua user story, use case, business rule.
- Moi rule thay doi phai co ID (US-001, BR-014) de reference.

### docs/03_system_design.md

- Cap nhat khi: thay doi schema, ERD, sequence diagram, Redis key, Lua script.
- Muc "Bang X" phai sync voi migration 1:1 (ten cot, type, constraint, FK).
- ERD Mermaid phai render duoc (mo preview trong Cursor).
- Lenh kiem tra nhanh: grep "CREATE TABLE\|flash_sale:\|reserve_stock" docs/03_system_design.md.

### docs/04_architecture_analysis.md

- Cap nhat khi: thay doi kien truc lon (them pattern moi, doi persistence).
- KHONG trung lap voi 03 (03 chi tiet hon).

### docs/api/api-document.md

- Cap nhat khi: them/sua endpoint, request/response shape, error code.
- Moi endpoint co: Method, URL, Access, Request schema, Response schema, Error codes.
- Muc 26 (Error Code) phai day du, sort theo alphabet.
- Lenh kiem tra nhanh: grep "/api/v1/\|status.*[0-9]{3}" docs/api/api-document.md.

### docs/flashsale_order_contract.md

- Cap nhat khi: thay doi contract giua flashsale module va order module.
- Anh huong: FlashSaleOrderPort interface, CreateFlashSaleOrderCommand, OrderRef, ExpiredOrderRef.

### AGENTS.md

- Cap nhat khi: them convention moi, doi rule nghiep vu, mo rong API list.
- KHONG tu y sua boi agent khi phat hien sai - bao user (xem source-of-truth.mdc).

## Checklist dinh kem moi PR

Trong mo ta PR, tac gia **PHAI** list:

- docs/01_project_planning.md (N/A neu khong dung).
- docs/02_requirement_analysis.md (N/A neu khong dung).
- docs/03_system_design.md (N/A neu khong dung).
- docs/04_architecture_analysis.md (N/A neu khong dung).
- docs/api/api-document.md (N/A neu khong dung).
- docs/flashsale_order_contract.md (N/A neu khong dung).
- AGENTS.md (N/A neu khong dung).

Neu file khong can sua -> ghi ro "N/A (ly do)".

## Khi phat hien docs khong khop code

- Code = source of truth cuoi cung (xem source-of-truth.mdc).
- Bao user, **khong tu y** sua docs.
- Neu user duyet -> tao **1 commit rieng** "docs: sync X voi code" de de review.
- Commit docs KHONG de rieng 1 thang sau commit code.

## Khi co thay doi breaking API

Ngoai viec sync docs, agent phai:

1. Danh version moi cho endpoint (vd /api/v2/...).
2. Giu endpoint cu 1 release cycle (vd 1 thang) truoc khi xoa.
3. Ghi ro trong api-document.md muc "Deprecated endpoints".
4. Bao team FE bang note trong PR.